@CoreAuthAPI_HostAddress = https://localhost:7284

### Kullanıcı Kaydı (Register)
POST {{CoreAuthAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "stajyer@sirket.com",
  "password": "SuperGizliPassword123!"
}

### Kullanıcı Girişi ve Token Alma (Login)
POST {{CoreAuthAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "stajyer@sirket.com",
  "password": "SuperGizliPassword123!"
}

### ---------------- TEST ALANI ---------------- ###

### 1. Herkese Açık Alan
GET {{CoreAuthAPI_HostAddress}}/api/test/public

### 2. Korumalı Alan (Token Gerektirir)
GET {{CoreAuthAPI_HostAddress}}/api/test/protected
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### 3. Sadece Müşteriler Girebilir
GET {{CoreAuthAPI_HostAddress}}/api/test/customer-only
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### 4. Sadece Adminler Girebilir
GET {{CoreAuthAPI_HostAddress}}/api/test/admin-only
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_YOUR_TOKEN_HERE